<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Alert–Ticket Saga Failed</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a;">
  <h2 style="color: #b32424;">🚨 Saga Failed — Admin Reprocess Required</h2>
  <p>Alert–Ticket orchestration saga đã chuyển vào terminal state <strong>Failed</strong>.
     Cần admin intervention để reprocess hoặc reconcile.</p>

  <table style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Correlation (Alert) ID</strong></td><td>{{CorrelationId}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Alert ID</strong></td><td>{{AlertId}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Ticket ID</strong></td><td>{{#if TicketId}}{{TicketId}}{{else}}—{{/if}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Asset</strong></td><td>{{AssetSerialNumber}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Failed At Stage</strong></td><td>{{FailedAtStage}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Reason</strong></td><td>{{Reason}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Error Code</strong></td><td>{{#if ErrorCode}}{{ErrorCode}}{{else}}—{{/if}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Failed At</strong></td><td>{{FailedAt}}</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h3>Reprocess instructions</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Mở Admin portal → Sagas → Alert-Ticket → tìm AlertId <code>{{AlertId}}</code>.</li>
    <li>Xem failure detail, kiểm tra runbook <code>08-saga-failed.md</code>.</li>
    <li>Nếu safe-to-reprocess: bấm <strong>Reprocess</strong> (cần Idempotency-Key).</li>
    <li>Nếu data conflict: dùng <strong>Reconcile</strong> (xem runbook <code>10-saga-duplicate-canonical.md</code>).</li>
  </ol>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
    Sprint 5B #238. Email gửi cho user role Admin (primary) + Manager (CC).
  </p>
</body>
</html>
